WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.662
The governance I'd bring
to deliver it safely.

2
00:00:02.662 --> 00:00:07.326
The data foundation first: an authority
map with one owner per attribute,

3
00:00:07.326 --> 00:00:10.513
and an enterprise person
key the agency controls.

4
00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:13.062
A security assessment of the data flow.

5
00:00:13.062 --> 00:00:16.624
An acceptance gate with a signed
validation before cutover.

6
00:00:16.624 --> 00:00:19.688
And a cutover that proves
HR is the sole source for

7
00:00:19.688 --> 00:00:22.750
a population before the
ticket path closes for it.

8
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.165
Then the operating
rules on the bottom row,

9
00:00:25.165 --> 00:00:27.787
from lifecycle rules
through change control.

10
00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:34.683
Together that produces evidence for AC-2,
PS-4, PS-5, IA-4 and SI-12 as a byproduct

11
00:00:34.683 --> 00:00:40.713
of operating — supporting those controls,
not claiming to close them on its own.
